key.aoc.tooltip.entity=Controls when entity rendering can be hidden to reduce visual rendering cost. Entities remain active.
key.aoc.tooltip.item=Controls dropped-item rendering in the world. Items continue to exist and function normally.
key.aoc.tooltip.tile=Controls TileEntity rendering without unloading them or changing their behavior.
key.aoc.tooltip.particle=Reduces distant particle rendering without changing the logic that creates particles.
key.aoc.tooltip.effect=Controls client-side visual effects without changing game state.
key.aoc.tooltip.occlusion=Hides rendering only when safe solid-block occlusion confirms that the object is outside the visible path.
key.aoc.tooltip.reset=Restores the AOC default option values.
key.aoc.tooltip.entity_distance=Sets how far entities can remain visible through the AOC rendering policy.
key.aoc.tooltip.item_distance=Sets how far dropped items can remain visible through the AOC rendering policy.
key.aoc.tooltip.tile_distance=Sets how far TileEntities can remain visible through the AOC rendering policy.
key.aoc.tooltip.particle_distance=Sets how far particles can remain visible through the AOC rendering policy.
key.aoc.tooltip.effect_distance=Sets how far visual effects can remain visible through the AOC rendering policy.
key.aoc.tooltip.budget=Sets how many occlusion checks AOC may perform per tick. More checks update occlusion faster but use more CPU.
key.aoc.impact.low=Current impact: low (%d). A shorter distance reduces rendering work and can improve performance.
key.aoc.impact.medium=Current impact: medium (%d). Balances visibility and rendering cost.
key.aoc.impact.high=Current impact: high (%d). A longer distance keeps more objects visible and can increase rendering cost.
key.aoc.impact.budget_low=Current impact: low (%d). Fewer checks use less CPU, but occlusion can update more slowly.
key.aoc.impact.budget_medium=Current impact: medium (%d). Balances occlusion responsiveness and CPU cost.
key.aoc.impact.budget_high=Current impact: high (%d). More checks update occlusion faster with higher CPU cost.
